  "description": "Read and write SSRS and Power BI paginated report definitions (.rdl, .rdlc) as reports, losslessly, across the 2005, 2008, 2010 and 2016 schemas. Elements, attributes and namespaces DocWright does not model are preserved, so a designer can open a report, edit it and save it without rewriting what it did not understand. DTDs are refused and nesting and element counts are bounded. Use with DocWright.Reporting to validate, upgrade, run and paginate the report.",
